# CLAUDE.local.md — Machine-Specific Configuration
#
# Copy this file to CLAUDE.local.md and fill in your local paths.
# CLAUDE.local.md is gitignored — it stays on this machine only.

## Stata Configuration

# Path to Stata executable (uncomment and edit for your machine)
# Windows — auto-detect order: StataNow19 → Stata18 → Stata17
# stata_path: "C:/Program Files/Stata19/StataNow-MP.exe"
# stata_path: "C:/Program Files/Stata18/StataMP-64.exe"
# stata_path: "C:/Program Files/Stata17/StataMP-64.exe"

# macOS
# stata_path: "/usr/local/stata18/stata-mp"

# Linux
# stata_path: "/usr/local/stata18/stata-mp"

## Julia Configuration

# Julia is typically on PATH; only set if using a non-standard install
# julia_path: "julia"

## LaTeX Engine

# pdflatex for papers (faster, wider compatibility)
# xelatex for slides (Unicode, custom fonts)
latex_engine_papers: pdflatex
latex_engine_slides: xelatex

## Python Configuration

# python_path: "python3"

---

## Example: Benny's Laptop (Windows)

```
stata_path: "C:/Program Files/Stata19/StataNow-MP.exe"
julia_path: "julia"
latex_engine_papers: pdflatex
latex_engine_slides: xelatex
```

## Example: Benny's Office Desktop (Windows)

```
stata_path: "C:/Program Files/Stata18/StataMP-64.exe"
julia_path: "julia"
latex_engine_papers: pdflatex
latex_engine_slides: xelatex
```
